{
    "title": "Arm Wrestling Master",
    "description": "Arm Wrestling Master takes you on an exhilarating adventure with Macho! In this arcade-style game, you control Macho as he collects muscle training equipment, improves his physical fitness, and attempts to become the ultimate arm wrestling champion.\r\n\r\nDive into the world of \"Arm Wrestling Master\" and navigate through various levels filled with challenges and surprises. Avoid various obstacles and collect dumbbells and other essential muscle training tools. Test your skills in this casual yet thrilling game that combines elements of action, strategy, and puzzle solving.\r\n\r\nMaster arm wrestling and take on a variety of enemies. Hone your skills and challenge the odds with the help of the tools you've collected.\r\n\r\nWith engaging gameplay, and just the right amount of humor, \"Arm Wrestling Master\" provides hours of entertainment for gamers of all ages. So, are you ready to take control of the macho and become the ultimate arm wrestling master? Play \"Arm Wrestling Master\" now and see what you can do!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Arm Wrestling Master takes you on an exhilarating adventure with Macho! In this arcade-style game, you control Macho as he collects muscle training equipment, improves his physical fitness, and attempts to become the ultimate arm wrestling champion.<br><br>Dive into the world of &quot;Arm Wrestling Master&quot; and navigate through various levels filled with challenges and surprises. Avoid various obstacles and collect dumbbells and other essential muscle training tools. Test your skills in this casual yet thrilling game that combines elements of action, strategy, and puzzle solving.<br><br>Master arm wrestling and take on a variety of enemies. Hone your skills and challenge the odds with the help of the tools you&#39;ve collected.<br><br>With engaging gameplay, and just the right amount of humor, &quot;Arm Wrestling Master&quot; provides hours of entertainment for gamers of all ages. So, are you ready to take control of the macho and become the ultimate arm wrestling master? Play &quot;Arm Wrestling Master&quot; now and see what you can do!",
    "summary": "Exciting arm-wrestling battles in which well-trained muscles collide!",
